  "summary": "I have always had an interest in Software Development. Ever since I was young I was interested on how stuff works and I will try to create new things. Before I attended college, I learned Java and Android App Development on my own because I wanted to explore more into software development. I also attended a gala for women in STEM, so I could connect with others and learn more about the STEM industry.During this gala, women from the STEM industry, spoke about their experience in their industry and how women can succeed in the STEM industry. At the end of the gala, I received a scholarship that helped me pursue my studies at the University of North Texas. My strong curiosity in computers and experience from the gala, eventually led me to major in Computer Science.  \n\nI want to become a Software Developer because computers are becoming a necessity in people's lives. From the medical field to the business field, computers are used for different purposes, and Software Developers are needed to create software for these computers. Software development requires time and dedication and I am up for the task. I hope to become a Software Developer so I can assist people with their daily lives.",
